## Settings for the server's Erlang VM (see `mix help release`).

## When there's no work, the VM keeps its cores spinning for a moment, waiting
## for more. The database runs on the same few cores and needs them more, so
## the VM lets go of them at once (load test, 1 Nov: the cores were full).
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
